    ],
    "text": "I, Maithree Gunaratne, Governor of the Central Province, hereby make following regulations by virtue of the powers vested in me bySection 188 (i) m. m. and Section 289 of the Municipal Councils Ordinance (Chapter 252) which should be read with Section 2 of theProvincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989. This Order shall be effective from 08th of May, 2019.",
